    {
      "text": "Each layer is often about 30 microns thick.",
      "say": "Each layer is often about thirty microns thick.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "30 microns",
        "sub": "Each layer, often"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Some printers jet pure wax, and others harden liquid resin with light.",
